       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. NUMVALDEMO.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 TEXT-AMT  PIC X(10) VALUE " 1234.50  ".
       01 AMT       PIC 9(5)V99.
       01 NAME-IN   PIC X(10) VALUE "alice".
       01 NAME-OUT  PIC X(10).

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           COMPUTE AMT = FUNCTION NUMVAL(TEXT-AMT) * 2
           DISPLAY "DOUBLED: " AMT
           MOVE FUNCTION UPPER-CASE(NAME-IN) TO NAME-OUT
           DISPLAY "UPPER:   " NAME-OUT
           DISPLAY "LENGTH:  " FUNCTION LENGTH(NAME-IN)
           STOP RUN.
